<!--
  Both halves of the app in one mark: a map pin — where you were — with an eighth note punched
  through it — what you were there for. The note is a hole rather than a second shape, so the
  whole thing stays a single silhouette that survives being tinted for a themed icon and shrunk
  to a notification badge.

  Sized against the 72dp a launcher actually shows of this 108 viewport (18..90), not the whole
  plate: the pin spans y 31.5..76.5, which leaves it room to breathe inside a circle mask instead
  of pressing against it. The note is cut deliberately large — a delicate one turns to mush at the
  44px a launcher folder shows.
-->
